    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0150_154560b13406.png\" style=\"width: 193px; height: 206px;\" /><br /><br />In the acidic medium, only basic nitrogen is protonated. The second nitrogen is less basic because the lone pair is involved in aromaticity, while <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> are more basic.</p>"
